  "Question": "Which of the following conditions is sufficient to guarantee that integers \\(x,\\) \\(y,\\) and \\(z\\) satisfy the equation \\[ x(x-y)+y(y-z)+z(z-x) = 1? \\]",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\( x \\gt y\\) and \\(y=z\\)",
    "B": "\\( x=y-1\\) and \\(y=z-1\\)",
    "C": "\\( x=z+1\\) and \\(y=x+1\\)",
    "D": "\\( x=z\\) and \\(y-1=x\\)",
    "E": "\\( x+y+z=1 \\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "D",
